Enemy12: I feel lost for words. I just poured out my heart and...
Enemy12: "I hope you find whatever it is you're looking for..."
Enemy12: "That's it then... Goodbye, Hero."
Enemy12: I wish it was a friend you were looking for. I wish it was me.
Enemy12: I watch you leave... leave me behind to return to my perpetual solitude.
Enemy12: There's a sadness. The sadness of losing a friend. Of missing an opportunity.
Enemy12: But then... [pause=1]There's hope. I shamble towards the stairs, where you'd come from.
Enemy12: I know there are more things down there. Things like me...
Enemy12: Things looking for a friend.
Enemy12: In all this time, I have never left the bridge.
Enemy12: I look at the stairs leading down, Gather my courage, and then...
